{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/1431","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/1431/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/1431/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/1431/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/1431","id":241975517,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNDE5NzU1MTc=","number":1431,"title":"VsCode cmake-tools plugin hangs when using the vcpkg toolchain file","user":{"login":"bjude","id":4530480,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MzA0ODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4530480?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude","html_url":"https://github.com/bjude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":453053596,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NTMwNTM1OTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/labels/category:vcpkg-bug","name":"category:vcpkg-bug","color":"ff3333","default":false,"description":"The issue is with the vcpkg system (including helper scripts in `scripts/cmake/`)"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2017-07-11T09:01:03Z","updated_at":"2017-07-11T21:10:41Z","closed_at":"2017-07-11T21:10:03Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The configure step (of cmake) hangs when using the cmake-tools pluging for VsCode.\r\n\r\nI have setup vcpkg and installed it. The following lines were added to my vscode user settings in order for the cmake tool to find my toolchain file.\r\n```\r\n\"cmake.configureSettings\": {\r\n    \"CMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE\" : \"D:/Code/vcpkg/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake\"\r\n},\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter running cmake with some extra flags for verbosity i could see that it hanging on the getWindowsSdk.ps1 script. More details can be found [here](https://github.com/vector-of-bool/vscode-cmake-tools/issues/202)\r\n\r\nI got everything working by modifying the powershell call [here](https://github.com/Microsoft/vcpkg/blob/master/scripts/cmake/vcpkg_get_windows_sdk.cmake#L4) adding ```INPUT_FILE NUL``` like so:\r\n\r\n```\r\nexecute_process(\r\n    COMMAND powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command \"& {& '${VCPKG_ROOT_DIR}/scripts/getWindowsSDK.ps1'}\" 2>&1\r\n    INPUT_FILE NUL\r\n    OUTPUT_VARIABLE WINDOWS_SDK\r\n    RESULT_VARIABLE error_code)\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'll open a pull request if theres no objections here.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"ras0219-msft","id":12301622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzAxNjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12301622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft","html_url":"https://github.com/ras0219-msft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ras0219-msft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/1431/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/1431/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}